<title>HONG KONG: Nomura sets China Overseas Land warrants.</title>
<headline>Nomura sets China Overseas Land warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International (Hong Kong) Ltd said it intended to issue 620 million American-style call warrants on shares of China Overseas Land &amp; Investment Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$2.9025     PREMIUM	 17.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.087752   GEARING	 3.67X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 03.JUN.98     LISTING DATE  18.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   HK$3.225</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
